be the underlying view.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to:\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><span class=\"kw2926\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">common_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>__as_sentinel<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*sentinel*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to:\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><span class=\"kw2926\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">common_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>__as_sentinel<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*sentinel*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/adjacent_view/iterator\">iterator</a> to the element following the last element, if the underlying view <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">V</span></code> models <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><code>common_range</code></a>. Otherwise, a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/adjacent_view/sentinel\">sentinel</a> which compares equal to the end iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/adjacent_view\"><span class=\"kw3677\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">adjacent_view</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V,N<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> models <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\